    "description": "<p>This document describes advanced features of the Shapes Constraint Language (SHACL) including features to define custom targets, annotation properties, user-defined functions, node expressions and rules. While many of these features rely on SPARQL, they also define extension points that can be used by other implementation languages. </p>",
